ungeonSelectScreen, DungeonHUDScreen, LevelUpScreen, RunResultScreen, RoyalDecreeScreen, DiscoveryBookScreen, BuildingDetailScreen, SettingsScreen\n- `UI/Components/`: ResourceBar, SkillButton, FloatingText\n\n---\n\n## 4. Model Knowledge\n\n### Architecture Decisions\n- **Namespace convention:** `MiniKingdom.Core`, `MiniKingdom.Combat`, `MiniKingdom.Dungeon`, `MiniKingdom.Kingdom`, `MiniKingdom.UI`, `MiniKingdom.Data`, `MiniKingdom.Player`, `MiniKingdom.Enemy`, `MiniKingdom.Items`, `MiniKingdom.Utils`\n- **Architecture pattern:** MVVM with UniRx Observable binding\n- **Event system:** Static generic EventBus with Subscribe/Unsubscribe/Publish pattern\n- **Data management:** ScriptableObjects for static game data, JSON for save data\n- **Async:** UniTask for async operations (GC-free)\n- **Object pooling:** Generic `ObjectPool<T> where T : Component`\n- **State machine:** GameState enum controls game flow (Kingdom → DungeonSelect → InDungeon → Combat → LevelUp → RunResult)\n\n### Game Design Key Formulas\n- **Damage:** `baseDmg = ATK × skillMultiplier; defReduction = 100/(100+enemyDEF); finalDmg = baseDmg × defReduction × typeModifier × critMultiplier × Random(0.9,1.1)`\n- **Type modifier:** weakness=1.3, resistance=0.7, neutral=1.0\n- **Run failure retention:** 70% of collected resources kept\n- **Daily bonus:** First 5 runs = 1.5x rewards, resets at 5 AM\n- **Equipment enhance:** +1~5=100%, +6~8=70%, +9~10=50% success; NO destruction on failure\n- **Kingdom level = total sum of all building levels**\n\n### Subagent Type Defined\n- **`unity-developer`** — custom subagent with write tools, detailed system prompt about Unity C# standards, Korean comments, and full game context. Can be re-invoked for future tasks.\n\n---\n\n## 5. Files and Code\n\n### Created Files\nAll under `c:\\Users\\JCHJ\\Desktop\\Antigravity\\mini-kingdom\\`:\n\n| File | What | Why |\n|------|------|-----|\n| `README.md` | Project overview, doc structure | Entry point for project |\n| `docs/01-g